# All cached artifacts (JSON + .npz) are committed so the repo is self-contained:
# `git clone` -> figures and tables reproduce with no external download.

# The parent research repository ignores activation arrays globally. This
# release is the deliberate exception: only the curated figure-ready caches
# under data/ are versioned.
!data/**/*.npz
!assets/shapes_3d.html

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# Figure outputs (regenerated from data/)
figures/output/
figures/*.png
figures/*.pdf
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.pdf
*.tmp
